    "notes": "The November 18 Protomaps multi-line feature contains two crossing segments. The north-up photo trace and September 2026 aerial photo identify the short eastern masonry crossing and its signed axis. The placement replaces only that segment. The western crossing retains its geometry, and model failure restores the eastern procedural crossing. The local grade and fixed water stage preserve three open vaults and both approach joints."
  },
